Package: corMLPE
Title: Correlation Structures for Symmetric Relational Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nathaniel", "Pope", email = "nspope@utexas.edu", role = c("aut")),
        person("Bill", "Peterman", email = "peterman.73@osu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Implements correlation structures for symmetric relational data
    (e.g. pairwise distances and dissimilarities) that interface with models
    using 'nlme'-style correlation structures.
